![Asebbel deg wemkan-nneɣ (2): Asebbel di Lɛahd Ajdid... akk-d ssuq n waklan](/images/posts/nt-redemption-kab.png)

> « Axaṭer Mmi-s n bunadem ur d-yusi ara iwakken ad qedcen fell-as, meɛna yusa-d iwakken ad yili d aqeddac, yerna ad isebbel tudert-is d asebbel deg wemkan n waṭas n yemdanen » (Marqus 10: 45).

Nfukk deg umagrad amezwaru ɣef yiwet n tideț n Tira Iqedsen ur nqebbel ara ccek: nukkni d imedyanen i lḥeqq n Sidi Ṛebbi amatu, yerna ulac aserreḥ neɣ tilelli baṭel; aserreḥ yeḥwaǧ "awli" izemren ad ibedd deg wemkan-nneɣ yerna ad ixelleṣ cciṛa s lekmal-is i lḥeqq n Sidi Ṛebbi. Dagi i d-icṛeq Lexbaṛ n Lxiṛ ɣef tgelda n Ṛuman anda aklan llan d amur ameqqran di tmetti. Di lḥala-yagi, ixtaṛ Ṛṛuḥ Iqedsen imeslayen ibanen yerna d iqeddacen aṭas iwakken a ɣ-d-issefhem d acu i gexdem Lmasiḥ.
D acu i d cciṛa yețwaxelṣen d asebbel?
Tuffɣa si ssuq
Iwezlan akk-d temselɣa
## Tutlayt tayunanit akk-d ssuq n waklan (Lutron)
M'ara neɣṛi awal n "Asebbel" neɣ "Afdu" (Lutron) di Lɛahd Ajdid, yezmer ad d-yas ɣer tmusni n umeɣṛi n tura belli d "Leslak" amatu kan. Lameɛna lefhama-yagi txuṣṣ aṭas 1.
Deg umaḍal ayunani akk-d uṛumani, tawacult n yimeslayen icudden ɣer usebbel (am: Lutron - Luṭrun) ur țțuseqdac ara maḍi s lmeɛna n leslak war cciṛa. Meɛna tella d awal n ttjaṛa akk-d lqanun i gețțuseqdacen di "ssuq n waklan". Asebbel (Lutron) d: cciṛa yețwaxelṣen iwakken ad iserreḥ i wakli ad yawi tilelli-ines, neɣ cciṛa yețwaxelṣen iwakken ad iserreḥ i umeḥbus n tṭṛad.
Amek i t-tella tețwaxdem tuffɣa n wakli si zik? Ɣef lḥesab n lqanun di lweqt-nni, ur s-ț-id-iṣaḥ ara i wakli ad yesɛu agerruj i yiman-is; axaṭer ayen akk i d-ijemmeɛ d ayla n wemɛellem-is s lḥekma n lqanun. Daymi, ɣas akken yezmer wakli a d-ihejji cciṛa n usebbel-is a s-t-yefk i wemɛellem-is iwakken ad yaɣ tilelli-ines, amɛellem-nni yezmer s lqanun ad iṭṭef idrimen-nni am akken d ayla-s yerna ad yeǧǧ akli-nni di tkelwa! Iwakken ad iffeɣ si ddiq-agi n lqanun, akli ad iṛuḥ ad ixelleṣ idrimen-is di texzint n yiwen n lǧameɛ n iṛebbiten n wat lbaṭel. Imiren lmuqeddem ad yaɣ akli-nni i lḥesab n lmeṣnuɛ. Nnatija dagi ț-țagi: akli ad yețwaserreḥ s lekmal si wemɛellem-is n lqaɛa, lameɛna di yiwet n teswiɛt ad yuɣal "d atɛiq n wemɛabud yerna di yiwet n tikkelt d ayla-s" 2. Akli yeḥwaǧ "wi tlata aḥuṛṛi" (Lmeṣnuɛ/Lmuqeddem) ad ikcem di lḥala-yagi n lqanun iwakken ad iḍmen beddel n wayla.
Dagi nțwali Aḥader n Ṛebbi eɛlayen yerna isdehacen; am akken iseqdec Sidi Ṛebbi lumuṛat n Lɛahd Aqdim akk-d lemtul-is iwakken ad iheggi ixemmimen n wat Isṛail iwakken ad sṭerḥben s "Wemsellek", akka daɣen iseqdec nniḍam n "ssuq n waklan" d lqwanen n tilelli di tmetti tayunanit akk-d tṛumanit iwakken ad iheggi ixemmimen n leǧnas iwakken ad fehmen taluft n leslak tameqqrant di lweqt meṛṛa! Leslak n Lmasiḥ mačči d "lqesd n ssmaḥ" kan i d-yekkan seg igenni, lameɛna ț-țamsalt n "tiɣin" n ṣṣeḥ, i deg ixelleṣ Lmasiḥ cciṛa n usebbel-nneɣ iwakken a ɣ-isellek si tkelwa n lxeṭya iwakken a nuɣal d ayla-s s lekmal. Akken i d-yenna wemceggeɛ: « Axaṭer tețwaɣem s cciṛa. Efkent ihi tamanegt i Sidi Ṛebbi deg iǧețțen-nwen d leṛwaḥ-nwen yellan d ayla n Sidi Ṛebbi » (1 Kurintus 6: 20).
## Aḥerf issebgan-d tideț n "Tbedlit" (Anti = deg wemkan n)
Yenna Sidi Yasuɛ: « Axaṭer Mmi-s n bunadem ur d-yusi ara iwakken ad qedcen fell-as, meɛna yusa-d iwakken ad yili d aqeddac, yerna ad isebbel tudert-is d asebbel deg wemkan n [anti-lutron] waṭas n yemdanen » (Marqus 10: 45, Matta 20: 28). Awal ayunani yețțuterjmen "deg wemkan n" dagi d aḥerf (anti - anti) deg wawal amseddas (anti-lutron) 3.
Aḥerf-agi (i gextaṛ Ṛṛuḥ Iqedsen s tṣeḥḥit deg uweḥḥi) isbeggin-d s tideț cceɣl n Sidi Yasuɛ mi gefka iman-is d abedil deg wemkan-nneɣ. Di tutlayt tayunanit, aḥerf (anti) ur isɛi ara kan lmeɛna n "ɣef ddemma neɣ i lfayda" n yiwen, meɛna isɛa s tṣeḥḥit lmeɛna n usrusu n tɣawsa neɣ n wemdan deg wemkan n wemdan nniḍen: "d abedil i" neɣ "deg wemkan n" (In place of / In exchange for). Amedya n tutlayt yufraren si Tterjma Tasebɛinit d lqanun n ccreɛ: « Tiṭ deg wemkan n (anti) tiṭ » 4. Ț-țamsalt n umbeddel s lekmal.
Dagi ițemlili Lɛahd Ajdid akk-d wawal n nnbi n (Iceɛya 53) ameqqran. Imeslayen n Lmasiḥ ț-țawin-d srid cṣifa n "uqeddac yețwaɛetben" i geɛebban lxeṭyat n wiyaḍ: « Meɛna yețwagreḥ ɣef ddemma n lɛeṣyan-nneɣ, yețwaṛeẓ ɣef ddemma n lxeṭyat-nneɣ, lɛiqab i ɣ-d-yewwin lehna yeɣli-d fell-as... yerna Sidi Ṛebbi isers-ed fell-as lxeṭya-nneɣ irkulli... Axaṭer yețwawet ɣef ddnub n wegdud-iw... yerna d nețța ara yeɛebbin lxeṭyat-nsen... yerna iɛebba lxeṭya n waṭas n yemdanen, yerna icfeɛ deg imednuben » (Iceɛya 53: 5-12). Awal-agi (Anti-lutron) itekkes yal aɛṛaḍ n tukksa n lmeɛna n tbedlit n wumidag! Lmasiḥ ur d-yusi ara ad inɛețțab "yid-nneɣ" s tdukli di lmeḥnat-nneɣ, meɛna yusa-d ad yețwagreḥ, ad yețwaṛeẓ yerna ad yețwawet deg wemkan-nneɣ, deg wemkan n uwet i glaq a d-yeɣli fell-aɣ ɣef ddemma n lxeṭyat-nneɣ i geɛebba deg wemkan-nneɣ. Ibedd deg wemkan anda nukkni i glaq a nbedd, yețwaḥkem fell-as am ukeddab di Ṛebbi d umcum yeɛebba-d lḥekma i yuklal yal yiwen deg-nneɣ, yerna yețwaɛaqeb s lɛiqab-nneɣ yuklalen d uḥeqqi.
Ameceggeɛ Bulus issebgan-d lmeɛna-yagi s lǧehd di (1 Timuti 2: 6) m'ara d-iṣeff Lmasiḥ: « Win isebblen iman-is d asebbel deg wemkan n meṛṛa ». Awal i gețțuseqdacen dagi d yiwen n wawal amseddas (Anti-lutron - Anti luṭrun) yeɛni "asebbel deg wemkan n meṛṛa", i gețțuterjmen s lḥerf: "Asebbel abedli".
Akken i d-yenna Bulus daɣen: « Win i gețțusellmen ɣef ddemma n lxeṭyat-nneɣ yerna iḥya-d ɣef ddemma n uzki-nneɣ » (Ṛumiya 4: 25). Yețțusellem Lmasiḥ ɣer lḥekma n lmut "ɣef ddemma n lxeṭyat-nneɣ" (aḥerf n lǧerṛ ayunani Dia "ɣef ddemma" issebgan-d ssebba yeɛni: ɣef ddemma n lxeṭyat-nneɣ) 5; lxeṭyat-nneɣ llant d ssebba i gḥettmen afak n usebbel-agi abedli.
Lmasiḥ ur yeldi ara tawwurt n lḥebs ad aɣ-issiwel s tuffra, lameɛna nețța yekcem ɣer lḥebs, yeṭṭef amkan-nneɣ, yerna ixelleṣ cciṛa s lekmal-is i lḥeqq n Sidi Ṛebbi s leɛtab-is d lmut-is ɣef wumidag, dɣa neffeɣ-d nukkni d iḥuṛṛiyen s "uzki n lqanun i lebda" akk-d "lxelq ajdid".
## D acu i d cciṛa yețwaxelṣen d asebbel?
Nwala di Lɛahd Aqdim belli asṛaili yella yețțak-ed "lfeṭṭa n usebbel" i Sidi Ṛebbi d asebbel ɣef yiman-is (Tuffɣa 30). Lameɛna, di Lɛahd Ajdid, d acu i d cciṛa yețwaxelṣen iwakken a ɣ-d-yaɣ si ssuq n waklan?
Yerra-d wemceggeɛ Buṭrus s tideț di (1 Buṭrus 1: 18-19):

> « Imi teẓram belli tețwafdam mačči s tɣawsiwin ifennun, s lfeṭṭa neɣ s ddheb... lameɛna s idammen ɣlayen, am idammen n yizemmer zeddigen ur nesɛi lɛib, idammen n Lmasiḥ ».
> Cciṛa ur tella ara d idrimen ifennun, lameɛna tella d tudert n Mmi-s n Ṛebbi i d-yuɣalen d amdan; cciṛa tella d « ...idammen n Lmasiḥ, win i gefkan iman-is i Sidi Ṛebbi s Ṛṛuḥ n lebda ur yesɛi lɛib... » (Iɛibṛaniyen 9: 14). Idammen di Tira Iqedsen d tudert, akken i d-issebgan uweḥḥi iqedsen: « Axaṭer tudert n lgețța tella deg idammen, fkiɣ-awen-t-id ɣef udekkan n iseflawen i usebbel ɣef leṛwaḥ-nwen, axaṭer idammen țsebblen ɣef teṛwiḥt » (Allawiyen 17: 11). Dagi ur ilaq ara ad nețțu ṣṣifa n tbedlit tabaṛzazt di tefyirt "i usebbel ɣef leṛwaḥ-nwen"; axaṭer lmut (azzaz n idammen) tella d asebbel n lḥeqq awḥid i ddnubat-nneɣ akk-d tṭuɣyan-nneɣ ɣef Wexamlaq. Iwakken a nețwaserreḥ, yella ilaq ad ițwaxelleṣ usebbel-agi neɣ cciṛa n tilelli. Dɣa iqeṛṛeb-ed awli (Lmasiḥ) ixelleṣ tudert-is d idammen-is zeddigen d (asebbel abedli Anti-lutron) iwakken ad iṛḍi iḥewwigen n tqedsit d lḥeqq n Ababat s lekmal.
> Daymi, m'ara issegzi wemceggeɛ Bulus: « țwazekkayen baṭel s tmella-s s usebbel yellan di Sidi Yasuɛ Lmasiḥ » (Ṛumiya 3: 24), nețța yesmektay-aɣ-d belli uzki "d baṭel" ɣuṛ-nneɣ nukkni kan, axaṭer ur nxelleṣ acemma, lameɛna ur yelli ara baṭel maḍi ɣer Sidi Ṛebbi; iqam-as kullec. D wagi i d "umbeddel isdehacen" i ɣef tcenna tajmaɛt n cceṛq di tẓalliyin-is teqqaṛ: "D nukkni i gednenben, d nețța i genɛețțaben. D nukkni i guɣalen d imedyanen i lḥeqq n Ṛebbi s ddnubat-nneɣ, d nețța i gexelṣen tṭlaba deg wemkan-nneɣ" 6. Nukkni d aklan imedyanen, nețța d Sidi i gexelṣen cciṛa n usebbel-nneɣ s idammen-is zeddigen!
## > Tuffɣa si ssuq
> Iwalen i gseqdec uweḥḥi iwakken a d-issefhem ɣef usebbel (Lutron) akk-d usebbel abedli (Anti-Lutron) ssefkent-aɣ-d s tṣeḥḥit meqqren belli leslak-nneɣ yedṛa s cceɣl n "tbedlit" ițwaxelṣen deg-s cciṛa ɣlayen "idammen n Mmi-s" (1 Yuḥenna 1: 7), neɣ akken i d-yenna wemceggeɛ Bulus "idammen n Sidi Ṛebbi" mi iheddeṛ i lecyux n Afasus: « ... iwakken aț-țeksam tajmaɛt n Sidi Ṛebbi i d-yuksa s idammen-is » (Lcɣal 20: 28), iwakken a ɣ-isellek si tkelwa iwakken a nuɣal d ayla n Sidi Ṛebbi.
> Deg umagrad i d-iteddun a nkemmel taɣuri n iwalen n Lɛahd Ajdid icudden ɣer usebbel.
> Ɣeṛ daɣen di sselesla n usebbel deg wemkan-nneɣ:
> Aḥric amezwaru: Asebbel di Lɛahd Aqdim... anwa i d awli?

## Iwezlan akk-d temselɣa
## Muris, Lyun. Abeccer n wemceggeɛ s wumidag (The Apostolic Preaching of the Cross), Ixef amezwaru: Asebbel.

## Issefham-d umusnaw n tutlayt Adulf Daysman (Adolf Deissmann) belli cceɣl-agi yella yețțwassen zik s yisem (Sacral Manumission).

## Issebgan-d D. Lqess Ɣassan Xalaf deg usegzawal-is n tutlayt tayunanit belli aseqdec n wawal "Anti-lutron" yefka-d lmeɛna n usrusu n usebbel d abedil s lekmal, anda Yemsebbel yeṭṭef amkan n win i gețwasebblen.

## Tterjma Tasebɛinit ț-țaterjmat tayunanit n Lɛahd Aqdim (Allawiyen 24: 20).

## Issefham Lqess Ɣassan Xalaf belli aḥerf n lǧerṛ (Dia / διά) akk-d lḥala n usrusu yețțak-d lmeɛna n "Ssebba" (Because of / On account of), ayen issebganen belli lxeṭyat-nneɣ llant d "ssebba" i gḥettmen Lmasiḥ ad isebbel iman-is d abedil deg wemkan-nneɣ.

## Tiẓalliyin n tqesmat iqedsen (Taqesmat tasyeryanit), Lituṛjiya n tejmaɛt taqibṭit tuṛṭuduksit. (Wali asmel n Anba Takla).

